1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,980
What if light moved at walking speed?

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:03,700
You'd see your friend's smile late…

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,740
and the Sun from over 3,000 years ago.

4
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,980
Stand 1 meter from a mirror and wave.

5
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:11,700
Your reflection waves back over a second later.

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:12,440
Now the Sun.

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:15,360
Today its light takes about 8 minutes to reach us.

8
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,320
At walking speed?

9
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:18,140
Over 3,000 years.

10
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:22,140
The sunlight on your face would have left when the pyramids were already ancient.

11
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,600
So this subscribe button?

12
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:25,800
Its light is still walking toward you.

13
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:26,440
Meet it halfway.

14
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:27,240
Subscribe.
